## How to zip / attach

This pack is evidence, not an authorization decision.

```
onboard zip --pack {{ pack_dir }} --out onboard-pack.zip
```

Attach `onboard-pack.zip` to the ISSM ticket or eMASS artifact upload. There is no eMASS API in v0.1.
